              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "40:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Tena urefu wa elfu ishirini na tano, na upana wa elfu kumi, ni sehemu ya Walawi, wahudumu wa nyumba, iwe milki yao wenyewe kwa vyumba ishirini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanyi mtaiandika milki ya mji, upana wake elfu tano, na urefu wake elfu ishirini na tano, kandokando ya mahali palipotolewa, iwe sehemu takatifu; nayo itakuwa ya nyumba yote ya Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
